  "_comment": "Single source of truth for the courtyard. The search indexer, the roadmap renderer, and (optionally) the book cards all read from this file. To add a new book: (1) add an entry to `books` below, (2) drop the book folder in the repo, (3) if you want it on the reading path, add its number to the right `roadmap` phase, (4) run `node scripts/build-search-index.js`. See scripts/README.md.",
